<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - June 20.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - June 20.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Thursday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Consol Rutile	 195.18    0.83</p>
<p> 2   Mt Leyshon Gold	13.89    1.80</p>
<p> 3   Cudgen R.Z.	     9.43    2.65</p>
<p> 4   Aust Tour		 9.26    0.81</p>
<p> 5   Prime Credit Tr	 8.97    1.09</p>
<p> 6   Prop Income Inv	 8.62    1.17</p>
<p> 7   Centro Prop	     8.59    2.24</p>
<p> 8   BT Prop Trust	   8.54    1.91</p>
<p> 9   Indu Property	   8.49    1.00</p>
<p>10   Natl Consol	     8.33    1.08</p>
<p>11   Ipoh			8.29    2.17</p>
<p>12   Davids Limited	  8.26    1.21</p>
<p>13   Schroder Prop	   8.22    2.25</p>
<p>14   Colonial Mutual	 8.02    1.33</p>
<p>15   Natl In Prop	    7.97    1.10</p>
